Async Alembic environment.

Common commands:

    # Apply all pending migrations
    alembic upgrade head

    # Roll back the most recent migration
    alembic downgrade -1

    # Roll back to empty
    alembic downgrade base

    # Show current revision
    alembic current

    # Generate a new (empty) revision
    alembic revision -m "describe change"

    # Autogenerate from model diff (use with care — raw DDL features
    # like generated columns, partial indexes, triggers, and pg_trgm
    # GIN indexes will NOT be detected; review and patch by hand).
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
